            </div>
          </details>
          
          <details class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-sm group">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--senec-blue)] pr-4">Wie viele Anlagen hat Presolaris bereits installiert?</h3>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--senec-turquoise)] transform group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
